    }], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"9537efa5-ff6a-4702-830a-96aa36a2e6aa"]},
   {"Master", 
    StyleBox["option", "TI"], Cell["\<\
xAct option: the master symbol the definition is tied to; undefining the \
