\>", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"45103cb7-c547-4cac-be21-4db14e557725"]},
   {"Manifold", 
    StyleBox["essential", "TI"], Cell["\<\
the base manifold (or list of manifolds) the object lives on; the Def \
command's manifold argument\
\>", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"e12cdc16-1033-41e2-a9b5-fb2840cee64c"]},
   {"CNumbersOf", 
    StyleBox["essential", "TI"], Cell["\<\
the coordinate numbers of the chart or basis, as a list of integers\
\>", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"2cca90fb-5f0c-4abd-a218-69ba1f3ceb98"]},
   {"ScalarsOfChart", 
    StyleBox["essential", "TI"], Cell["\<\
the coordinate scalar fields of the chart, in coordinate-number order\
\>", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"169e4479-d8ea-41f9-8436-ba7de66a5a9e"]},
   {"Name", 
    StyleBox["runtime", "TI"], Cell[TextData[{
     "a string; ",
     Cell[BoxData[
      TemplateBox[{
        Cell[
         TextData["SaveData"]], 
        "paclet:VasilDimitrov/SolutionsX/ref/SaveData", 
        "VasilDimitrov Package Symbol"},
       "PackageLink",
       BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",
      FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
      "dadc75e1-6be5-4fb8-801e-ad0ac6628750"],
     " builds the entry name from the first manifold's Name and Dimension, \
