\>", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"7157f524-fa53-4a0e-bc66-e97d73127545"]},
   {"ProtectNewSymbol", 
    StyleBox["option", "TI"], Cell["\<\
xAct option: whether the new symbol is protected after definition\
\>", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"e8171773-55db-4055-8c39-5d837ad9e9f4"]},
   {"Dagger", 
